    "https://careers.msu.edu/jobs/assistant-professor-tenure-system-east-lansing-michigan-united-states-329f6b2f-6b94-4941-9d04-c8f42487ed55": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor-Tenure System",
      "description": "Assistant Professor-Tenure System - East Lansing, Michigan, United States Assistant Professor-Tenure System - East Lansing, Michigan, United States Kiosk mode Assistant Professor-Tenure System Accounting And Information Systems 10008009 Faculty/Academic Staff Assistant Professor-Tenure System East Lansing, Michigan, United States Accounting And Information Systems 10008009 Area of Interest: Financial/Accounting Full Time/Part Time: Full Time (90-100%) Group: Tenure System Faculty Remote Work: Remote-Friendly Union/Non-Union: Non-Union Show More Show Less Faculty/Academic Staff Opening on: Jul 17 2026 Closing at: Jul 17 2028 - 23:55 EDT Salary Commensurate with Experience Eli Broad College Of Business 1147950 Add to favorites View favorites Position Summary The Department of Accounting and Information Systems in the Broad College of Business at Michigan State University invites applications for multiple full-time tenure track positions at the level of Assistant Professor. The focus is on candidates with a research emphasis in archival financial accounting topics, but we welcome candidates from other areas to apply. Candidates must hold a Ph.D. in Accounting or related field as of June 1, 2027. We are interested in candidates who produce research of excellent quality that will have a high impact on the field. The primary responsibilities for each position include research, teaching, and engaging in service activities for the academic discipline, department, college, and university. Candidates must have the ability to teach successfully in undergraduate and graduate programs. We are looking for candidates who can contribute to the thought leadership and excellence of our current group of accounting and information systems faculty. Please note that this is a union position represented by the Union of Tenure System Faculty (UTSF). The university is working with the union to establish a collective bargaining agreement. Equal Employment Opportunity Statement All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, citizenship, age, disability or protected veteran status. Required Degree Doctorate -Ph.D. in Accounting or related field as of June 1, 2027 Minimum Requirements Ph.D. in Accounting or related field as of June 1, 2027 Required Application Materials CV, Letter of Interest, Teaching Philosophy, Evidence of Teaching Effectiveness Review of Applications Begins On 07/31/2026 We encourage applicants to continue to apply after 7/31/2026 as we will be reviewing applications on a rolling basis until the positions have been filled. Remote Work Statement MSU strives to provide a flexible work environment and this position has been designated as remote-friendly. Remote-friendly means some or all of the duties can be performed remotely as mutually agreed upon. Website https://broad.msu.edu/accounting/ Department Statement The Department of Accounting and Information Systems is known for our outstanding faculty as well as our excellence in research and teaching.The AIS department is ranked 19th overall in archival research by the BYU research rankings, and our PhD program is ranked 14th using the same rankings. Our undergraduate and masters programs are all ranked in the top 20 by U.S. News among public universities. Named as one of the top 10 universities in the nation to work for, Michigan State Universityis located in East Lansing, Michigan, an attractive community appreciated for its high quality of life, excellent schools, and easy access tomajor Midwest population centers, along with boundless recreation and cultural opportunities. The Eli Broad College of Business, with over 4,000 undergraduate and graduate students, consistently ranks among the top public business schools. MSU Statement Michigan State University has been advancing the common good with uncommon will for more than 160 years. One of the top research universities in the world, MSU pushes the boundaries of discovery and forges enduring partnerships to solve the most pressing global challenges while providing life-changing opportunities to a diverse and inclusive academic community through more than 200 programs of study in 17 degree-granting colleges. Apply Now Not Quite What You're Looking For? Sign Up For Job Alerts First Name (required) 8b537c41 Last Name (required) 0ce68f88 Email (required) 9187a338 Job Alert 614b6ccd Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments Accounting And Information Systems 10008009 Accounting And Information Systems 10008009 Categories Area of Interest: Financial/Accounting Full Time/Part Time: Full Time (90-100%) Group: Tenure System Faculty Remote Work: Remote-Friendly Union/Non-Union: Non-Union Area of Interest: Financial/Accounting Full Time/Part Time: Full Time (90-100%) Group: Tenure System Faculty Remote Work: Remote-Friendly Union/Non-Union: Non-Union Employment Type Faculty/Academic Staff Faculty/Academic Staff Locations East Lansing, Michigan, United States East Lansing, Michigan, United States Unit Eli Broad College Of Business Eli Broad College Of Business By clicking Send, you acknowledge that you are willing to receive SMS messages from Michigan State relating to the status of your application or other recruitment related information to any mobile / cell phone number entered in the form above. You can easily opt-out of receiving SMS messages by replying STOP to any messages you receive. Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Interested In Other Jobs At MSU? Check out these other recently posted roles that might be right for you! Executive Mgtmt Director-Exec Mgt East Lansing Msu It Campus It Experience 40000843 Join MSU IT where you’ll have the opportunity to influence enterprise-wide IT services at a leading public research university, shape the future of campus technology experiences, and lead teams that make a meaningful impact on students, faculty, staff, and the broader MSU community. Professional Aide Project Pay East Lansing Music 10030598 The College of Music offers an opportunity for classical musicians who are seeking to accompany other musicians and entertain our audiences with professional and thrilling performances Assistant/Associate Professor Tenure System East Lansing Psychology Social Science 10038698 The Department of Psychology at Michigan State University is recruiting a faculty member with expertise in industrial and organizational psychology or a related field for a tenure system appointment at the assistant or associate professor level starting Fall 2027. Herder I East Lansing Campus Livestock Centers Canr 40001114 This is a temporary position. MSU Dairy Teaching and Research Center is looking for an someone to assist with daily chores associated with caring for a large herd of livestock. Academic Program Coordinator East Lansing Graduate School Dean 10067378 The Graduate School is looking for a professional with in-depth experience with the SIS system (student.msu.edu) and the University’s Admissions platform (Slate). [Bidding eligibility ends October 20, 2026, 11:55 PM] Senior Production Manager / Stage Manager East Lansing Performing Arts Facilities & Programs 10052643 Wharton Center for Performing Arts seeks an organized, collaborative Senior Production Manager to help bring live performances and events to the stage. Working closely with the Technical Director, this position coordinates technical production for touring attractions, performances, rehearsals, rentals, and special programs. (The Bidding Eligibility ends on 10/20/2026 at 11:55 PM) Already applied? Click here Apply Now First Name (required) d75c9017 Last Name (required) c9b6060c Email (required) b20d1d7a Refer someone to this job