      "description": "Postdoctoral Scholar-Fixed Term - East Lansing, Michigan, United States Postdoctoral Scholar-Fixed Term - East Lansing, Michigan, United States Kiosk mode Postdoctoral Scholar-Fixed Term Chemistry 10032142 Faculty/Academic Staff Postdoctoral Scholar-Fixed Term East Lansing, Michigan, United States Chemistry 10032142 Area of Interest: Research/Scientific Full Time/Part Time: Full Time (90-100%) Group: Fixed Term Academic Staff Union/Non-Union: Non-Union Show More Show Less Faculty/Academic Staff Opening on: Jun 25 2026 Closing at: Jun 25 2028 - 23:55 EDT Salary Commensurate with Experience College Of Natural Science 1143145 Position Summary This position will center on the development of new catalysts for selective synthesis. The role offers opportunities for training in: high-throughput experimentation asymmetric catalysis organometallic synthesis quantum mechanical simulations chem-informatics Equal Employment Opportunity Statement All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, citizenship, age, disability or protected veteran status. Required Degree Doctorate -chemistry or related sciences Minimum Requirements PhD in chemistry or related sciences Desired Qualifications Strong track record of research productivity Required Application Materials Cover letter Curriculum vitae Names and email addresses of 2-3 references Review of applications will on begin July 9, 2026, and continue until the position has been filled. Website https://www.chemistry.msu.edu/ Department Statement Michigan State University has been advancing the common good with uncommon will for more than 160 years. MSU Statement Michigan State University has been advancing the common good with uncommon will for more than 160 years. One of the top research universities in the world, MSU pushes the boundaries of discovery and forges enduring partnerships to solve th