      "description": "Assistant Professor-On-Call - East Lansing, Michigan, United States - Grand Rapids, Michigan, United States Assistant Professor-On-Call - East Lansing, Michigan, United States - Grand Rapids, Michigan, United States Kiosk mode Assistant Professor-On-Call Chm West Michigan 10022803 Faculty/Academic Staff Assistant Professor-On-Call East Lansing, Michigan, United States Grand Rapids, Michigan, United States Chm West Michigan 10022803 Area of Interest: Education/Training Area of Interest: Health Care Professional Full Time/Part Time: On-Call Group: Faculty Academic Staff On-Call Union/Non-Union: Non-Union Show More Show Less Faculty/Academic Staff Opening on: Nov 24 2025 Closing at: Nov 24 2027 - 23:55 EST Pay Commensurate with Experience College Of Human Medicine 1097459 Working/Functional Title Assistant Professor-On-Call Position Summary Responsible for completing academic assignments from units within Academic Affairs. Academic assignments could include creating curricular materials, presenting lectures, facilitating small groups discussions, teaching clinical skills, and evaluating/teaching students in simulated environment for testing and trainings. This position is located at the Secchia Center in Grand Rapids with the College of Human Medicine. Equal Employment Opportunity Statement All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, citizenship, age, disability or protected veteran status. Required Degree Doctorate -PhD, MD or DO Minimum Requirements PhD, MD or DO with 1-2 years clinical and teaching experience is required. Required Application Materials Applicants will be required to submit: CV Cover Letter Special Instructions N/A Applications will be reviewed as needed. Work Hours Up to 16 hours a week. Website HTTP://HUMANMEDICINE.MSU.EDU MSU Statement Michigan State University has been advancing the common good with uncommon will for more than 160 years. One of the top research universities in the world, MSU pushes the boundaries of discovery and forges enduring partnerships to solve the most pressing global challenges while providing life-changing opportunities to a diverse and inclusive academic community through more than 200 programs of study in 17 degree-granting colleges. Apply Now Not Quite What You're Looking For? Sign Up For Job Alerts First Name (required) ccdefea5 Last Name (required) 246baff5 Email (required) d1b0f5f1 Job Alert 4f4aea46 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments Chm West Michigan 10022803 Chm West Michigan 10022803 Categories Area of Interest: Education/Training Area of Interest: Health Care Professional Full Time/Part Time: On-Call Group: Faculty Academic Staff On-Call Union/Non-Union: Non-Union Area of Interest: Education/Training Area of Interest: Health Care Professional Full Time/Part Time: On-Call Group: Faculty Academic Staff On-Call Union/Non-Union: Non-Union Employment Type Faculty/Academic Staff Faculty/Academic Staff Locations East Lansing, Michigan, United States Grand Rapids, Michigan, United States East Lansing, Michigan, United States Grand Rapids, Michigan, United States Unit College Of Human Medicine College Of Human Medicine By clicking Send, you acknowledge that you are willing to receive SMS messages from Michigan State relating to the status of your application or other recruitment related information to any mobile / cell phone number entered in the form above. You can easily opt-out of receiving SMS messages by replying STOP to any messages you receive. Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Interested In Other Jobs At MSU? Check out these other recently posted roles that might be right for you! Executive Mgtmt Director-Exec Mgt